    - m_language:
        m_address:
          m_low: 681352171529052915
          m_high: 2314507893210082619
      title: Move Chest Content
      description: 'While holding the bind key:

        Click a chest to mark it
        (gold highlight). Click the same chest again to unmark.

        With a
        chest marked, click a different chest to transfer all items from the marked
        chest into the target chest.

        Items exceeding the target chest''s
        capacity will remain in the source chest.'
